 "remarks": "AN AMAZING YEARLY RENTAL OPPORTUNITY! Ideally located on prestigious North Avenue, conv to Westport's award-winning schools, \"MEADOW WOOD\" offers nearly 2 ac of spectacular, pvt grounds & an extraordinary bonus for the car enthusiast-a separate gated driveway leading to a 2,447+/- sf party barn w/ storage for up to 14 cars. Completely remodeled & expanded for modern living, this estate is totally fenced/screened w/pvcy trees and features a stunning main residence, gunite pool & exceptional outdoor spaces. Gated driveways serve both the main house & barn, creating a pvt compound w/remarkable flexibility. The echoes of a Hollywood-style estate combine w/incredible updates thru-out the interiors. The front-to-back LR has a distinctive bay window & dual doors to a porch o'looking the grounds. The great room is the focal point of this expertly-designed floorplan, combining a Chef's Kit w/expansive island, endless storage, Thermador appliances & casual dining area, flowing into the DR & FR where a wall of folding glass doors creates a connection between the gorgeous interior & exterior spaces. A BR suite w/pvt access, lg laundry rm, mudrm, garage & powder rm complete this level. Upstairs, well-appointed BRs w/designer bths. The primary suite is an exquisite retreat w/tray ceiling, fpl, bth, walk-in dressing rm & an amazing balcony spanning much of the rear of the home. An elegant patio surrounds the heated pool. A truly special rental w/amenities rarely found in a yearly rental.",
